
form list
  note <List: the stdlib source of truth for the list type. The compiler uses the native array representation, so a list value is built with `make list`. Each method delegates to the native array operation.>

  head t

  task size
    take self
    like number
    send back, read self/length

  task is-empty
    take self
    like boolean
    send back
      call is-equal
        read self/length
        mark 0

  task push
    take self
    take item, like t
    like number
    send back
      call self/push
        read item

  task get
    take self
    take index, like number
    like t
    send back
      call self/at
        read index

  task contains
    take self
    take item, like t
    like boolean
    send back
      call self/includes
        read item

  task find-index
    take self
    take test
      like task
        take item, like t
        like boolean
    like number
    send back
      call self/findIndex
        read test

  task join
    take self
    take separator, like text
    like text
    send back
      call self/join
        read separator

  task reverse
    take self
    like list
    send back
      call self/toReversed

  task concat
    take self
    take other, like list
    like list
    send back
      call self/concat
        read other

  task slice
    take self
    take start, like number
    take end, like number
    like list
    send back
      call self/slice
        read start
        read end

  task map
    head s
    take self
    take call
      like task
        take item, like t
        like s
    like list
    send back
      call self/map
        read call

  task filter
    take self
    take test
      like task
        take item, like t
        like boolean
    like list
    send back
      call self/filter
        read test

  task any
    take self
    take test
      like task
        take item, like t
        like boolean
    like boolean
    send back
      call self/some
        read test

  task all
    take self
    take test
      like task
        take item, like t
        like boolean
    like boolean
    send back
      call self/every
        read test

  task reduce
    head s
    take self
    take call
      like task
        take total, like s
        take item, like t
        like s
    take initial, like s
    like s
    send back
      call self/reduce
        read call
        read initial
